<https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/sense/entry/ruD/dict/koch/1> a ontolex:LexicalSense ;
  skos:definition "रुध् I /rudh/ (A. pr. /rudhyate/ — IV- fut. /rotsyate/- pf. /rurudhe/- aor. /aruddhata/) 1) желать 2) подчинять"@ru ;
  pwglex:evidenceGrade gr:dict-attested ;
